# Cascading New task: program, then project, then that template's phases
Output "tui-11-new-task.gif"
Output "raw/tui-11-new-task.mp4"
Source "../tapes/_setup.tape"
Sleep 800ms
Ctrl+K
Type "tasks"
Sleep 500ms
Enter
Sleep 800ms
Down
# open: the control opens here (compose4.py syncs the 2x2 clips on it)
Insert
Sleep 800ms
Shift+Tab
Sleep 400ms
Type "d"
Sleep 600ms
Sleep 1500ms
Screenshot "raw/tui-11-new-task.png"
Sleep 1500ms
Escape
Escape
Sleep 500ms
